{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/rrprbq","slide":1,"text":"The system flow image represents the registered-farmer path. The added assisted path reflects the current code: center staff create the booking by phone, the farmer tracks by mobile or token without an account, and settlement is cash only because verified bank details were not collected.\n\nThe architecture image is embedded from the user-supplied PNG. Version labels are visually masked. Identity, PFMS and translation labels are qualified as demo adapters or fallbacks rather than live government integrations.\n\nEvidence: docs/pitch_deck/FEATURE_VALIDATION_CURRENT_CODEBASE.md; apps/api/src/modules/booking/booking.controller.ts; apps/api/src/modules/queue/queue.service.ts; apps/api/src/modules/payments/payment-policy.ts; apps/web/src/screens/PublicBookingTracking.tsx; apps/web/src/screens/CenterDashboard.tsx.\n\nImage sources: /Users/shubham/Downloads/AnnSetu System Architecture Flowchart.png; /Users/shubham/Downloads/WhatsApp Image 2026-09-15 at 13.29.58.jpeg."}